{"connections":{"Backend health check":{"main":[[{"index":0,"node":"Drive: list watched folder","type":"main"}]]},"Drive: list watched folder":{"main":[[{"index":0,"node":"Filter: changed since last run","type":"main"}]]},"Filter: changed since last run":{"main":[[{"index":0,"node":"Backend: re-ingest file","type":"main"}]]},"Nightly 02:00":{"main":[[{"index":0,"node":"Backend health check","type":"main"}]]}},"meta":{"notes":"Runs at 02:00 Europe/Berlin. Lists the watched Google Drive folder, keeps only files modified since the last successful run (static data watermark), and re-ingests those through the backend /files endpoint. Requires a Google Drive credential in n8n and the folder id set on the Drive node. Backend does extraction, chunking, embedding and Qdrant upsert; this workflow is scheduling and selection only.","templateCredsSetupCompleted":false},"name":"MS RAG Studio - 02 Nightly sync (Drive to Qdrant)","nodes":[{"id":"b1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001","name":"Nightly 02:00","parameters":{"rule":{"interval":[{"expression":"0 2 * * *","field":"cronExpression"}]}},"position":[240,300],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"b1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002","name":"Backend health check","parameters":{"options":{"timeout":15000},"url":"={{ $env.MSRAG_BACKEND_URL || 'http://host.docker.internal:8000' }}/health"},"position":[460,300],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"b1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003","name":"Drive: list watched folder","parameters":{"filter":{"folderId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"PASTE_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID"}},"options":{"returnedAll":true}},"position":[680,300],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive","typeVersion":3},{"id":"b1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004","name":"Filter: changed since last run","parameters":{"jsCode":"const watermark = $getWorkflowStaticData('global').lastSync || '1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z';\nconst changed = $input.all().filter(item => (item.json.modifiedTime || '') > watermark);\n$getWorkflowStaticData('global').lastSync = new Date().toISOString();\nreturn changed.map(item => ({ json: item.json, binary: item.binary }));"},"position":[900,300],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2},{"id":"b1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005","name":"Backend: re-ingest file","parameters":{"bodyParameters":{"parameters":[{"inputDataFieldName":"data","name":"file","parameterType":"formBinaryData"}]},"contentType":"multipart-form-data","method":"POST","options":{"timeout":300000},"sendBody":true,"url":"={{ $env.MSRAG_BACKEND_URL || 'http://host.docker.internal:8000' }}/files"},"position":[1120,300],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.2}],"pinData":{},"settings":{"timezone":"Europe/Berlin"}}